Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:31.90,Credit,,0,0,0,,Whip  @whipcampaigns\NSource: Fox News, Saturday in America, Nov. 21, 2026
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And one of the areas of\Nbipartisan commonality,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.70,0:00:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,you've previously suggested\Nperhaps a one-year
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.42,0:00:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,cap on credit card interest\Nrates at 10 percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.04,0:00:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a place you think you\Ncould work with Democrats
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,to accomplish something?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.68,0:00:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It is. I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.22,0:00:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't even know they said it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but they've been trying to\Nget that for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I would do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.48,0:00:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,These credit card companies\Nhave made a lot,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.34,0:00:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and the credit card fees\Nthat they charge,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.82,0:00:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm all into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that some people would say\Nit's not free enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.14,0:00:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But what's free enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're sitting home\Nand you get a bill
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.90,Default,,0,0,0,,that some guy set up\Nin an office on Park Avenue.
